        "sourceLanguageId": "go",
        "source": "// POSIX SIGTERM is 15.\nif threadworkRunner.GetShutdownSignal() == 15 {\n    threadworkRunner.ShutdownRequest()\n    return nil\n}",
        "specification": "Probes SIGTERM recorded by the Go runtime and requests an orderly network shutdown. This archetype defines the runner API expected by the Go compiler."
